OL,3,GNEWSARichard Rogers' home given to
OL,4,ANational Trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Trust has said the
OL,7,F"extraordinary gift" will "protect one
OL,8,Fof the UK's most important examples of
OL,9,Fmodern architecture for future
OL,10,Fgenerations".
